OL,3,AJury in Russell Brand rape trial begins
OL,4,Aconsidering verdicts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe jury has begun considering the
OL,7,Fverdicts in Russell Brand's rape and
OL,8,Fsexual assault trial.
OL,10,FThe media personality, 51, has been on
OL,11,Ftrial at Southwark Crown Court in
OL,12,FLondon for three weeks, facing three
OL,13,Fcounts of rape, three of sexual assault
OL,14,Fand one of attempted indecent assault.
OL,16,FHe has pleaded not guilty to all the
OL,17,Fcharges. Giving evidence, he told the
OL,18,Fcourt he had been "obsessed" with sex
OL,19,Fin the past, but insisted it was always
OL,20,Fconsensual.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
