SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1793783912
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJury in Russell Brand rape trial begins
OL,4,Aconsidering verdicts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charges relate to allegations from
OL,7,Fsix women spanning a decade between
OL,8,F1999 and 2009. Prosecutors said the
OL,9,Fcomplainants described him as someone
OL,10,Fwho "didn't listen" when they said no,
OL,11,Fand "didn't care".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
